# Samsung J5 2017: probing the FIMC-IS camera V4L2 nodes from Linux userspace
# (GStreamer plugin scanner, Firefox gfxtest, ...) triggers a kernel panic in the
# Exynos sysmmu code. Keep them root-only and do not grant session ACLs (uaccess).
SUBSYSTEM=="video4linux", TAG-="uaccess", TAG-="seat", MODE="0600", OWNER="root", GROUP="root"
